{
  "_comment": [
    "The editorial overlay for the Product OS map. Everything here is a judgement call:",
    "where a skill sits in the lifecycle, who runs it, what it feeds, and the curated flows.",
    "Everything derivable (which skills exist, their real descriptions, their status) is read",
    "from oolio-pm/skills/ at build time and is NOT repeated here.",
    "",
    "Add a skill to oolio-pm/skills/ and it appears on the map on the next build. Until it has",
    "an entry below it renders in a red 'unplaced' column, so it is never silently missing.",
    "",
    "stage = a column name below. row = vertical position within that column (0 at the top).",
    "type  = ai | orch | human | signal | output.",
    "feeds = outgoing connections; a string, or {to, label} for a labelled wire."
  ],

